    "detailed_description": "<strong>WHAT IS CONSTRUCTO - DUNGEONS BUILDER?</strong><br>Constructo is a tool that turns your imagination into reality. A virtual tabletop that packs a set of tools for your favorite tabletop RPG! Say goodbye to those unappealing last-second sketches and instead see maps with your own eyes in an incredible pulsating 3D full of life. That fire-breathing dragon has never looked so realistic!<br><br><br><strong>HOW TO CREATE A MAP?</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199560/extras/9311e25c18f51a68e3c3cd0c74b07d06.poster.avif?t=1728144853\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199560/extras/9311e25c18f51a68e3c3cd0c74b07d06.webm?t=1728144853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199560/extras/9311e25c18f51a68e3c3cd0c74b07d06.mp4?t=1728144853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>With the internal editor, you create your favorite maps. You can add  walls, floors, columns, and anything else you need to lay the  foundation for your dungeon. <br><br><strong>DO CLASSIC INDOOR SETTINGS FEEL CRAMPED?</strong><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199560/extras/9225da2e9c9993285974173f0395f577.poster.avif?t=1728144853\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199560/extras/9225da2e9c9993285974173f0395f577.webm?t=1728144853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2199560/extras/9225da2e9c9993285974173f0395f577.mp4?t=1728144853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br>Expand your boundaries. Bring the world to life with the terrain editor. Raise and lower the ground to your liking; level it, smooth it,  create your ideal world. Afterwards, color and customize it. Give free rein to your imagination.<br><br><strong>FREE FOR PLAYERS</strong><br><br>This version gives players free access to the GM's game. Only the GM will have to purchase the DLC &quot;Constructo - Dungeons Builder (GM Version)",
